{title: Estelar}
{artist: Capitán Melao}
{year: 2007}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}

{define: G base-fret 1 frets 0 2 3 2}
{define: Cmaj7 base-fret 1 frets 0 0 0 2}
{define: Em base-fret 1 frets 0 4 0 2}
{define: C base-fret 1 frets 0 0 0 3}
{define: A7 base-fret 1 frets 0 1 0 0}

{start_of_verse: Intro}
[G]· · · · | [Cmaj7]·     · · · | [G]· · · · | [Cmaj7]·     · · ·
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verso 1}
[G] Brillas cer[Cmaj7]ca
En[G]tregas, [Cmaj7]tu cuerpo
[G] Lates fuer[Cmaj7]te
De[G]seas, [Cmaj7]en silencio
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Coro}
[Em] Sabes ser[C] estelar[A7]   [C]
[Em] Sabes ser[C] estelar[A7]   [C]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Interludio}
[G]· · · · | [Cmaj7]·     · · · | [G]· · · · | [Cmaj7]·     · · ·
[G]· · · · | [Cmaj7]·     · · · | [G]· · · · | [Cmaj7]·     · · ·
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verso 2}
[G] Miénteme sua[Cmaj7]ve
Te [G]creo, [Cmaj7]con el tiempo
[G] Déjame al a[Cmaj7]ire
Me [G]seco, [Cmaj7]con tu cuerpo
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Coro 2}
[Em] Sabes ser[C] estelar[A7]   [C]
[Em] Sabes ser[C] estelar[A7]   [C]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Puente}
[Em] Cerca del [C]odio, cerca del [A7]gas [C]que quema
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Coro 3}
[Em] Sabes ser[C] estelar[A7]   [C]
[Em] Sabes ser[C] estelar[A7]   [C]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Em] Sabes ser[C] estelar[A7]   [C]
[Em] Sabes ser[C] estelar[A7]   [C]
[Em]   [C]  [A7]   [C]
[Em]↓
{end_of_verse}
